       <h1>AMU Celebrates Sir Syed Day, Announces KP Excellence Centre</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#Education</span> <span>#AMU</span> <span>#Donation</span> <span>#KP Group</span></div>
       <p>Aligarh Muslim University (AMU) recently celebrated Sir Syed Day, an event where speakers called for a renewed focus on education and social responsibility, according to India Education Diary.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-10-17/amu-celebrates-sir-syed-day-announces-kp-excellence-centre.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>During the celebrations, KP Group Chairman Faruk G. Patel announced a significant initiative. He committed to establishing a 'KP Excellence Centre' at AMU.</p><p>This new centre will be supported by a substantial donation of Rs 5 Crore from the KP Group, aiming to further enhance educational opportunities and resources at the university.</p><p>What to watch: Development and inauguration of the KP Excellence Centre at AMU.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: The draft is accurate and covers the essential facts provided in the source summary.</p>
