<!doctype html><html lang="en" data-theme="dark"><head><meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Kerala Government Increases Dearness Allowance to 37% — The Daily Prompt</title>
<meta name="description" content="The Kerala Finance Department issued an order on October 17, 2026, increasing the Dearness Allowance (DA) and Dearness Relief (DR) for government empl">
