      <ul><li><a href="https://www.thehindu.com/news/national/bihar/alleged-mobile-snatcher-caught-by-passengers-dragged-alongside-running-train-in-bihars-bhagalpur/article71580605.ece" rel="noopener">The Hindu</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       
