     <article class="story single" data-beat="entertainment">
       <div class="meta"><span class="beat-tag">ENTERTAINMENT</span> · Bollywood Hungama · 2026-10-17 · editor 10/10 · 1 min read <span class="badge ok">fact-checked</span></div>
       <h1>Sikandar Kher Praises Prahaar Team After Portraying Abbas Kazmi</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#entertainment</span> <span>#brief</span></div>
       <p>Actor Sikandar Kher recently shared a heartfelt social media tribute to the team behind &quot;Prahaar: The Untold Story of Ujjwal Nikam.&quot; Kher expressed deep gratitude to director Avinash Arun and producer Dinesh Vijan, highlighting Arun as a vital pillar of support during his challenging portrayal of defense lawyer Abbas Kazmi.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-10-17/sikandar-kher-praises-prahaar-team-after-portraying-abbas-ka.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>In the film, Kher plays the lawyer who represented Ajmal Kasab during the 26/11 trial, opposite Rajkummar Rao, who stars as public prosecutor Ujjwal Nikam. Kher praised Rao’s performance as career-defining and acknowledged the support of his co-stars and the Maddock Films production family throughout the demanding filming process.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: The brief is concise, accurate, and correctly attributes the sentiments expressed in Kher's social media post.</p>
       <div class="provenance">
      <b>Source</b>
      <ul><li><a href="https://www.bollywoodhungama.com/news/features/sikandar-kher-shares-emotional-note-for-prahaar-team-says-director-avinash-arun-was-his-pillar-of-strength-thank-you-for-the-ride/" rel="noopener">Bollywood Hungama</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       
