      <ul><li><a href="https://www.thehindu.com/news/national/telangana/telanganas-el-nino-contingency-plan-for-uninterrupted-water-supply-in-rural-areas/article71595939.ece" rel="noopener">The Hindu</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       
